{"ref":"BDB, מִקְשָׁה⁴","hw":"מִקְשָׁה⁴","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִקְשָׁה</span></big>  <strong>n.f.</strong> perhaps <strong>hammered work</strong>, only of metals <strong>(</strong>orig. <em>turner’s work</em>?<strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span>, of cherubim in tabern. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:18\" href=\"/Exodus.25.18\">Ex 25:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 37:7\" href=\"/Exodus.37.7\">37:7</a>, lamp-stand <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:31\" href=\"/Exodus.25.31\">25:31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:36\" href=\"/Exodus.25.36\">36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 37:17\" href=\"/Exodus.37.17\">37:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 37:22\" href=\"/Exodus.37.22\">22</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 8:4\" href=\"/Numbers.8.4\">Nu 8:4</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, clarions <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:2\" href=\"/Numbers.10.2\">10:2</a>.—i. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, קשׁא\" href=\"/BDB,_קשׁא\", dir=\"rtl\">קשׁא</a>.","next":"BDB, קָשַׁח","prev":"BDB, מִקְשֶׁה"}